            <p class="Division"><a name="10.80.20"></a>Division 10-80.20:<br />Definition of Specialized Terms, Phrases, and Building Functions</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1080020.html#10.80.20.005">10-80.20.005</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Generally</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1080020.html#10.80.20.010">10-80.20.010</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Definitions &ldquo;A&rdquo;</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1080020.html#10.80.20.020">10-80.20.020</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Definitions &ldquo;B&rdquo;</p>

