          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top" rowspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody">Greenhouses (retail) and greenhouses with garden supplies</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Toys and games </p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Variety stores</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Hobby materials</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Videos, DVDs, including rental</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
            <p class="P0"><span class="bold">General Services:</span> Facilities primarily engaged in providing personal services, commercial services, and miscellaneous repair services and shops, including but not limited to the following:</p>

      <table class="header1" style="text-align: left; width: 469.2232pt" cellspacing="0" summary="">
     <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 155.6673pt">
                        <p class="CellHeading">Commercial Services:</p>

          </th>
          <th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 129.3193pt">
                        <p class="CellHeading">Repair Services:</p>

          </th>
