                        <p class="CellBody">Petroleum and coal products</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Utility, production or processing facilities, but not offices or transmission or distribution</p>

          </td>
