      </table>
            <p class="P0"><span class="bold">Industrial, Light &ndash; General:</span> This use includes manufacturing, storage, transportation, construction, repair, and wholesale uses that do not include hazardous wastes or resulting large truck usage/parking on the site. Light industrial uses include, but are not limited to, the following:</p>

      <table class="Def" style="width: 385.4528pt" cellspacing="0" summary="">
